// Article 2. Members and dues.
#require "3-meetings.charter".
Param dues = $30.00
Act pay-dues Actor person Related to usd
  Holds when True
  Valid when usd >= dues
  Creates member(person) For 365 days

Use motion(usd) As dues-motion From 2.3
Power set-dues Actor club Related to usd
  Valid when dues-motion-carried(usd)
  Creates dues(usd)

Clause 2.1 => dues, pay-dues
Clause 2.2 => member, pay-dues
Clause 2.3 => dues-motion-vote-aye, dues-motion-vote-nay, set-dues.
